<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">1 Yohaanisa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Yohaanisa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yoha</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Yohaanisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaanisi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaariya Yohaanisi xaafida koyro kiitay, nam7u ayfe qofata oykees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Kiita nabbabeysati Xoossaranne iya na7aa Yesuus Kiristoosara issifetethi daana mela minthethanaasa.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Issifetethi dhaysiya wordo timirtefe haakana mela enta akeekisanaasa.</para>
  <para style="ip">He wode dendida wordo timirtey, “Xoossay bentonna ayyaana alame medhis. Ha bentiya alamiyanne nu asatethaa Xoossi medhiboonna gisho iita. Qassi ha bentiya alameynne nu asatethay nu ayyaana qohanawunne tunisanaw danda7enna” yaagidi tamaarsoosona. Hessa guussay,</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Yesuusi ase gididi yibeenna guussu;</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Issi asi ba ayyaana tunisonna de7ishe ba ashon nagara oothanaw danda7ees guussu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hessa gisho, Yohaanisi ba kiitan, Yesuusi ase gididi yidaysa kaddiya oonika Xoossa na7a gidenna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 4:2-3">4:2-3</ref></char>). Qassi Xoossafe yeletida oonika ubba wode nagaran deenna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 3:6">3:6</ref></char>) yaagidi xaafis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wordo astamaareti, “Atotethi guussi, ha sa7a duussas un7etethafe keydi yeda gididi de7o” yaagosona. Hessa bolla gujidi, “Iitanne lo77o shaakidi oykethi gidin, qassi hara asi siiqo gidin, atotethara aybi gahetethika baawa” yaagosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiita xaafey he timirtiya palqidi, “Yesuus Kiristoosi polo ase. Yesuusa ammaneysatinne Xoosse siiqeysati ubbay banta giddon issoy issuwara siiqetanaw bessees” yaagidi odis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">De7o immiya qaala <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Poo7onne dhuma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:5-2:6">1:5—2:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ooratha kiita <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 2:7-17">2:7-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosa morkenne Xoossa nayta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 2:18-3:10">2:18—3:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossa siiqonne nu siiqo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 3:11-4:21">3:11—4:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Alame xooniya ammano <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 5:1-21">5:1-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Nuuni koyrope doomidi de7iya, nu haythan si7ida, nu xeellida, ayfen be7ida, nu kushen bochida de7o qaalaba hintew xaafoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Yoha 1:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>He de7oy qoncin, nuuni iya be7idi, iyabaa markatoos. Aawa matan de7iya nuus qoncida, merinaa de7uwabaa hintew awaajos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Yoha 1:14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Nuura hintew issifetethi daana mela nuuni be7idaysanne si7idaysa hintew odoos. Hintew nuura issifetethi de7iya gisho, Aawaranne iya Na7aa Yesuus Kiristoosara issifetethi de7ees. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Nu ufaysay polo gidana mela hessa hintew xaafoos.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Nuuni de7o gidida iyape si7idi, hintew odiya kiitay haysa: “Xoossay poo7o; iyan dhumi baawa” yaageysa. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Nuus iyara issifetethi de7ees yaagishe dhuman de7iko, nu odaaninne nu oosuwan wordotoos. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Shin poo7on I de7eysada, nuka poo7on de7iko, nuus woli giddon issifetethi de7ees. Iya Na7aa, Yesuusa suuthay nagara ubbaafe nuna geeshshees.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Nuuni, nunan nagari baawa giiko nu nuna cimmoos; nunan tumi baawa. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>Shin Xoossaas nu nagara paaxiko, I nu nagara atto gaanawunne nu qoho ooso ubbaafe nuna geeshshanaw, ammanetidaysanne tumaa. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Nuuni nagara oothibooko giiko Xoossaa wordancho kessoos; iya qaalayka nunan deenna.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosi Nuus Gaannatees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>Ta nayto, nagara hinte oothonna mela taani haysa hintew xaafayis. Shin oonika nagara oothiko Aawa matan nuus gaannatiya Xilloy, Yesuus Kiristoosi, de7ees. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Nu nagaray Kiristoosa baggara atto geetetees. I nu nagaraa xalaalas gidonashin, asa ubbaa nagaraas yashetis.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Nuuni Xoossaa kiitaa naagiko, sidhey baynashin, tuma nu iya eroos. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Oonika, “Taani iya erayis” yaagishe, iya kiitaa naagonna ixiko he uray wordancho; tumatethi iyan baawa. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Shin iya qaalas nu kiitetiyaba gidiko he uray Xoossaa siiqiya siiqoy polo gidees. Nuuni Xoossan de7eysas hessi baw tuma marka. <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Taani, “Xoossan de7ayis” giya oonika Kiristoosi de7idaysada daanaw bessees.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooratha Kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>Ta siiqo ishato, taani hintew koyrope de7iya gal7a kiitaa xaafaysipe attishin, ooratha kiita xaafike. Ika hinte si7ida he gal7a kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Gidikoka, Kiristoosaninne hintenan tuma gididi de7iya, ooratha kiitaa xaafayis. Dhumay kichin, ha77i tuma poo7oy poo7ees.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>“Poo7on de7ayis” gishe ba ishaa ixiya oonika, ha77ika dhuman de7ees. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Ba ishaa dosiya oonika poo7on de7ees. He uran hara asi dhubiyabay baawa. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Shin ba ishaa ixiya oonika dhuman de7ees; dhuman hemetees. Dhumay iya ayfiya qooqisida gisho aw biyako erenna.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Ta nayto, Kiristoosa sunthaa baggara hinte nagaray atto geetetida gisho taani hintew xaafayis. <verse eid="1JN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Aawato, koyrope de7iya, iya hinte erida gisho hintew xaafayis. Yalagato, Xalahiya hinte xoonida gisho hintew xaafayis. <verse eid="1JN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Guutha nayto, Xoossaa hinte erida gisho hintew xaafayis. Aawato, koyrope de7iya iya hinte erida gisho hintew xaafayis. Yalagato, hinte mino gidiya gisho, Xoossaa qaalay hintenan de7iya gishonne Xalahiya hinte xoonida gisho hintew xaafayis.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Alame woyko alamen de7iyaba dosopite. Alamiya dosiya oonika Xoossaa dosenna. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Alamen de7iya ubbabay, asho amotethi, ayfen be7idi amotiyabaynne miishen ceeqetethi alamebape attishin, Xoossafe gidenna. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Alameynne alamen asi amotiya ubbay aadhana, shin Xoossaa sheniya poliya oonika merinaw daana.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosara Eqetiya Morkiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>Ta nayto, wodiya wursethay matatis. Kiristoosa morkey sinthafe yaanaysa hinte si7idaysada hari attoshin, ha77ika iya morketi daroti dendidosona. Hessa gisho, wodiya wursethay matatidaysa nuuni hessan eroos. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>He morketi nu bagga gidonna gisho nu giddofe keyidosona. Enti nu bagga gidiyako nu giddon de7ana, shin entafe oonika nu bagga gidonnaysi eretana mela nu giddofe keyidosona.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Shin Kiristoosi hinte bolla Geeshsha Ayyaana gussis; qassi hinte ubbay tumaa ereeta. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Tumaa hinte eriya gishonne tuman ayba wordoy baynaysa hinte eriya gisho, taani hintew xaafaysipe attishin, tumaa hinte eronna gisho gidenna.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Yesuusi, Xoossay dooridaysa gidenna gidi kaddiya asape hari wordanchoy oonee? Hessa mela asi Kiristoosa morke. I na7aa kaddiko Aawaka kaddees. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Na7aa kaddiya oodeska Aaway baawa; qassi Na7aas markatiya oodeska Aaway de7ees.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Hessa gisho, koyro hinte si7ida qaala hinte wozanan minthidi naagite. Koyro si7idaysa hinte naagiko hintew Na7aranne Aawara issifetethi daana. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Na7ay nuus merinaa de7uwa immana gidi qaala gelis.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Hintena balethiya asaa gisho taani haysa hintew xaafas. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Shin Kiristoosi hinte bolla ba Geeshsha Ayyaana gussis. Geeshsha Ayyaanay hintenan de7iya gisho oonika hintena tamaarso koshshenna. Iya Geeshsha Ayyaanay hintena tumaa tamaarsesipe attishin, wordo gidenna. Geeshsha Ayyaanay hintena tamaarsidaysada Kiristoosan de7ite.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Hiza, ta nayto, I qonciya wode nuuni yashshi baynanne iya yuussaa gallas iya sinthan nu yeellan qosetonna mela iyan de7ite. <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Kiristoosi xillo gideysa hinte eriko xillo oothiya ubbay Xoossaa na7a gideysa erite.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossaa Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Nuuni Xoossaa nayta geetetidi xeegetana mela Xoossay nuna ay mela dosidaako be7ite. Nuuni tumaka Xoossaa nayta. Ha alamey Xoossaa eronna gisho nunaka erenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yoha 1:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>Ta siiqo ishato, ha77i nuuni Xoossaa nayta; nuuni ay hananeeko buroo eretibeenna. Shin Kiristoosi qonciya wode nuuni iya daananaysa eroos. I tuma de7eysa nuuni be7ana. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Kiristoosa be7ana gidi ufaysan naagiya oonika, Kiristoosi geeshshi gididaysada bana geeshshees.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Nagari higge mentho gidiya gisho nagara oothiya ubbay Xoossaa higge menthees. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Kiristoosi asaa nagara dhaysanaw qoncidaysa hinte ereeta; iyan nagari baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Yoha 1:29</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Kiristoosan de7iya oonika nagaran deenna. Qassi nagaran de7iya oonika iya be7ibeenna woyko eribeenna.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>Ta nayto, hintena oonika balethofo. Kiristoosi xillo gididaysada xillo oothiya oonika xillo. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Xalahey koyrope nagara oothida gisho nagara ubba wode oothiya oonika Xalahe dabbo. Hessa gisho, Xoossaa Na7ay Xalahe ooso dhaysanaw qoncis. <verse eid="1JN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Xoossaa na7a gidiya oonika Xoossaa Ayyaanay iyan de7iya gisho, I ubba wode nagaran deenna. Xoossay iya Aawa gidiya gisho nagaran deenna. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Xoossaa nayta giddoninne Xalahe nayta giddon de7iya dummatethay hessan eretees; xillo oothonna asi woyko ba ishaa dosonna asi Xoossaa Na7a gidenna.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Issoy Issuwa Dosite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Koyrope hinte si7ida kiitay, “Issoy issuwa dosanaw bessees” giya kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Nuuni Qaayela mela gidanaw bessenna. Qaayela Xalahe dabbo gididi ba ishaa wodhis. I ba ishaa ayis wodhidee? Iya oosoy iita gidida gishonne iya ishaa oosoy lo77o gidida gisho wodhis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe 4:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Ta ishato, ha alamiya asay hintena ixiko malaaletofite. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Nuuni nu ishata siiqiya gisho, hayqope de7o pinnidaysa eroos. Ba ishaa dosonna oonika hayqo kuyan de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yoha 5:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Ba ishaa ixiya oonika shempo wodhees. Qassi shempo wodhiya oodeska merinaa de7oy baynaysa hinte ereeta. <verse eid="1JN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Kiristoosi ba shempuwa nu gisho aathidi immidaysan siiqoy aybeko nuuni erida. Nuka nu ishata gisho nu shempuwa aathidi immanaw bessees. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Shin dure gidida oonika metootanchuwa be7ishe, iyaw qadhetonna ixiko ba wozanan Xoossaa siiqoy de7ees gaanaw waanidi danda7ii? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>Ta nayto, nuuni oosoninne tumatethan nu siiquwa qoncisanaw besseesipe attishin, coo oda xalaalan woyko doona xalaalan siiqetanaw bessenna.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Nuuni issoy issuwa siiqiko, nu tumaa bagga gideysa eroos; hessas Xoossaa sinthan yeellatoko. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Nu wozanay nu bolla pirdiyaba gidiko, Xoossay nu wozanaape gita gideysa eroos; I ubbaba erees.<verse eid="1JN 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Ta siiqo ishato, nu wozanay nu bolla pirdonnaba gidiko nuuni Xoossaa sinthan yayyoko. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>Nuuni iya kiitaa naagiya gishonne iya ufaysiyabaa oothiya gisho woossiyaba ubbaa iyape ekoos. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Kiristoosi nuna kiittidaysada Xoossaa Na7aa Yesuus Kiristoosa sunthan ammananadanne issoy issuwa siiqanaada Xoossay nuna kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Xoossaa kiitaa naagiya oonika Xoossan de7ees; Xoossayka iyan de7ees. Xoossay nuus immida Geeshsha Ayyaana baggara I nunan de7eysa eroos.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayyaanata Shaakidi Erite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>Ta siiqo ishato, ayyaanata ubbaa ammanopite, shin enti Xoossafe yidaako paacidi be7ite. Ayis giiko, daro wordo nabeti alamen dendidosona. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Xoossaa Ayyaana gideysa hinte haysan erana; “Yesuus Kiristoosi ase gididi yidaysa markatayis” giya ayyaana ubbay Xoossafe yees. <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>Kiristoosi ase gididi yidaysa ammanayis goonna ayyaana ubbay Xoossaafe gidenna. Hessi Kiristoosa ixiya ayyaana. Hinte he ayyaanay yaanaysa kase si7ideta; I hari attoshin ha77ika alamen de7ees.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Ta nayto, hinte Xoossasa. Hinte giddon de7iya Geeshsha Ayyaanay alamen de7iya ayyaanape daro wolqaama gidiya gisho wordancho nabeta hinte xoonideta. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Enti ha alamiya ase gidiya gisho, ha alamiyaba odoosona; ha alamiya asay enta odaa si7oosona. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Nuuni Xoossaafe yeletida; Xoossaa eriya oonika nuna si7ees. Xoossaa eronna oonika nuna si7enna. Nuuni tuma ayyaananne wordo ayyaana hessan shaakos.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Ta siiqo ishato, siiqoy Xoossafe yaa gisho, ane issoy issuwara siiqetoos. Siiqiya oonika Xoossaa na7a; I Xoossaa erees. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Xoossay siiqo gidiya gisho siiqonna oonika Xoossaa erenna. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Nuuni Kiristoosa baggara de7uwa demmana mela Xoossay ba issi Na7aa ha alamiya kiittis. Xoossay nuna ba siiquwa hessan bessis. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Tuma siiqo guussay haysa: nuuni Xoossaa siiqida gisho gidonashin, Xoossay nuna siiqida gishonne nu nagaraape nuna maaranaw ba Na7aa kiitida gishosa.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Ta siiqo ishato, Xoossay nuna haysada siiqiko, nuka issoy issuwa siiqanaw bessees. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Xoossaa be7iday oonika baawa. Nuuni issoy issuwa siiqiko Xoossay nunan de7ees; iya siiqoyka nunan polo gidees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yoha 1:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Xoossay ba Geeshsha Ayyaana nuus immida gisho, nuuni Xoossan de7eysanne ika nunan de7eysa eroos. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Aaway ba Na7aa, ha alamiya ashsheysa gidana mela kiittidaysa nuuni be7idi markatoos. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Yesuusi Xoossaa Na7aa gideysa markatiya oodenka Xoossay de7ees; ika Xoossan de7ees. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Xoossay nuna siiqeysa nuuni eroosinne ammanoos.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Xoossay siiqo. Siiqon de7iya oonika Xoossan de7ees; Xoossayka iyan de7ees. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Nu de7oy ha alamiyan Kiristoosi de7idaysa mela gidiya gisho, pirda gallas yayyonna iya sinthe shiiqanaw iya siiqoy nunan polo gidees. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Siiqon yashshi baawa, tuma siiqoy yashshi kessi holees. Yashshinne pirdi issife biya gisho, yayiya uraa siiqoy polo gidenna.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Xoossay koyro nuna siiqida gisho nu siiqoos. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Oonika, “Xoossaa siiqayis” gishe ba ishaa ixiko, I wordancho. Ayis giiko, be7iya ba ishaa siiqonna oonika be7iboona Xoossaa siiqanaw waanidi danda7ii? <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Kiristoosi nuus immida kiitay haysa; “Xoossaa siiqiya oonika ba ishaa siiqanaw bessees” yaageysa.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Alamiya Xoono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Yesuusa, I Kiristoosa yaagidi, ammaniya oonika Xoossaa na7a. Aawa siiqiya oonika iya Na7aaka siiqees. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Nuuni Xoossaa siiqiya gishonne iya kiitaa naagiya gisho Xoossaa nayta siiqeysa eroos. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Nuuni Xoossaa siiqiko, iya kiitata naagoos. Iya kiitati deexo gidokona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Yoha 14:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>Ayis giiko, Xoossaa na7a gidiya oonika ha alamiya xoonanaw danda7ees. Nuuni ha alamiya xoonanay nu ammanuwana. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Alamiya xoonanaw danda7ey oonee? Yesuusi Xoossaa Na7aa gideysa ammaniya asa xalaali xoonana.<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosi Oonee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Yesuus Kiristoosi haatha xinqatiyaranne ba hayquwan gusida suuthara yis. I, haatharanne suuthara yisipe attishin, haatha xalaalara yibeenna. Geeshsha Ayyaanay tuma gidiya gisho, hessi tuma gideysa markatees. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Heedzu markati de7oosona. <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Hessati, Geeshsha Ayyaana, haathaanne suuthaa. Ha heedzata markatethay issino. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Nu asay markateysa ammanoos. Shin Xoossaa markatethay asaysafe daro aadhees. Xoossay ba Na7aas markatida markatethay haysa. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Xoossaa Na7aa ammaniya uraa wozanan ha markatethay de7ees. Xoossaa ammanonna oonika Xoossay ba Na7aas markatida markatethaa ammanibona gisho, Xoossaa wordancho oothees.<verse eid="1JN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>Hiza, markatethay haysa; Xoossay nuus merinaa de7o immis; he de7oyka iya Na7an de7ees yaageysa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Yoha 3:36</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Xoossaa Na7ay de7iya oodeska de7oy de7ees. Xoossaa Na7ay bayna oodeska de7oy baawa.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Merina De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Xoossaa Na7an ammaniya hintew merinaa de7oy de7eysa hinte erana mela haysa hintew xaafas. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Xoossaa sheniyada aybibaaka iya woossiko, I si7eysa nuuni eriya gisho iyan ammanetoos. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Nuuni woossiya ubbaa I si7eysa eriko, nuuni woossiyaba I immanaysa eroos.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Oonika ba ishay hayqo bessonna nagara oothishin be7iko, Xoossaa iyaw woossanaw bessees. Hayqo bessonna nagara oothidaysatas Xoossay de7o immana. Hayqo bessiya nagari de7ees. Taani hintena hessas Xoossaa woossite giike. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Iita ooso ubbay nagara, shin hayqo bessonna nagari de7ees.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Xoossaa Na7ay iya naagiya gisho, Xoossaa na7a gidida oonika nagaran ubba wode de7onnaysa nuuni eroos. Xalahey iya qohanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="1JN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Nuuni Xoossasa gideysanne ha kumetha alamey Xalahen haareteysa eroos.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Nuuni tuma Xoossaa eranaada Xoossaa Na7ay yidaysanne nuus akeeka immidaysa eroos. Nuuni iya na7a, Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara tuma Xoossan de7oos. Yesuusi tuma Xoossaanne merinaa de7uwa.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>Ta nayto, eeqatape hinte haakite.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
